s5-5-p4 = prose (cons "Finite executions are the inductively generated reflexive transitive closure with labels; continuing executions use the clocked cubical guarded process construction of §7.6, with its explicit later modality and clock quantification ([44](#ref-44)). Source behavior is the dependent family of executions and their observations, with truncation applied only when the property under consideration forgets witness identity. The deterministic command/response instance is defined below by a single signature and its guarded unfolding. For languages with unspecified evaluation orders, scheduling, or other nondeterminism, use the relation \(\mathsf{Step}\) rather than selecting an arbitrary successor." nil)
